TI  - Randomized clinical trial of VNUS® ClosureFAST™ radiofrequency ablation <i>versus</i> laser for varicose veins
AU  - Amanda C. Shepherd
AU  - Manj Gohel
AU  - Louise Brown
AU  - Matthew Metcalfe
AU  - Maher Hamish
AU  - Alun H. Davies
JO  - British journal of surgery
PY  - 2010
VL  - 97
